<view class="theme-{{themeKey}} page {{dark ? 'dark' : ''}}">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">截图认账</view>
    <view class="step"><text class="sn">列表页</text><text>支付宝 我的 → 账单、微信 我 → 服务 → 钱包 → 账单，停在列表页，滚动截屏可一次认多笔</text></view>
    <view class="step"><text class="sn">详情页</text><text>点进某一笔的「账单详情 / 支付凭证」再截图，一次认一笔——这种最准，因为带完整日期和交易单号</text></view>
    <view class="step"><text class="sn">要点</text><text>两种图可以混着一次多选（最多 9 张），逐张识别、最后合成一份预览；详情页重复导同一张不会翻倍</text></view>
    <view class="hint">截图会上传云端，由微信官方 OCR / 百度 OCR 识别，识别结束后尝试删除云端图片；确认导入后保存流水，使用共同账本时会同步。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">选图识别</view>
    <view class="btn {{busy ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="chooseShot">
      {{busy ? stepText : '选择账单截图（可多选，最多 9 张）'}}
    </view>
    <view class="bar" wx:if="{{busy && photos > 1}}">
      <view class="barin" style="width:{{done * 100 / photos}}%"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{photos > 1}}">共 {{photos}} 张，已处理 {{done}} 张</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!cloudReady}}" class="warn">
      云开发环境没准备好。先在开发者工具里开通「云开发」，再把 cloudfunctions/ocrText 上传部署；没配好时用「导入账单」页的复制粘贴。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{error}}">
    <view class="errbox">{{error}}</view>
    <view class="btn plain" bindtap="goImport">改用复制粘贴导入</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{preview}}">
    <view class="between title">
      <text>识别到 {{preview.total}} 笔</text>
      <text class="muted">{{preview.photos > 1 ? preview.photos + ' 张图 · ' : ''}}{{preview.source}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{preview.fails.length > 0}}">
      有 {{preview.fails.length}} 张没认出流水，这些图的内容没有进下面的预览：
      <view class="fail" wx:for="{{preview.fails}}" wx:key="no">第 {{item.no}} 张：{{item.why}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat">
      <view class="sitem"><text class="sv">{{preview.add}}</text><text class="sl">可新增</text></view>
      <view class="sitem"><text class="sv">{{preview.merged}}</text><text class="sl">合并</text></view>
      <view class="sitem"><text class="sv">{{preview.dup}}</text><text class="sl">跳重复</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="original-review" wx:if="{{preview.images.length > 0}}">
      <view class="between original-title">
        <text>原图核对</text>
        <text class="muted">{{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].label}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="imagetabs">
        <view class="imagetab {{reviewImageIndex === index ? 'on' : ''}}" wx:for="{{preview.images}}" wx:key="imageIndex"
              data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectOriginalImage">{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="original-stage" wx:if="{{preview.images[reviewImageIndex]}}">
        <image class="original-image" src="{{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].path}}" mode="widthFix" lazy-load="true"></image>
        <view class="ocr-layer">
          <view wx:for="{{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].boxes}}" wx:key="boxKey"
                class="ocrbox {{item.low ? 'low' : ''}} {{highlightKey === item.reviewKey ? 'highlight' : ''}}"
                style="left:{{item.leftPct}}%;top:{{item.topPct}}%;width:{{item.widthPct}}%;height:{{item.heightPct}}%;"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted original-meta" wx:if="{{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].width > 0}}">
        原图 {{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].width}} × {{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].height}} px · 已标 {{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].boxes.length}} 项
      </view>
      <view class="muted original-meta" wx:if="{{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].unmappedCount > 0}}">
        另有 {{preview.images[reviewImageIndex].unmappedCount}} 项缺少坐标或原图尺寸，请按下方文字核对。
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="reviewbox" wx:if="{{preview.lowCount > 0}}">
      <view class="reviewtitle">有 {{preview.lowCount}} 笔低置信度，请逐条核对</view>
      <view class="reviewhint">这些记录仍会导入，不会自动丢弃。点击条目定位原图框，也可直接修正。</view>
      <view class="reviewitem {{highlightKey === item.reviewKey ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{preview.lowItems}}" wx:key="reviewKey"
            data-index="{{item.parsedIndex}}" bindtap="focusReviewItem">
        <view class="reviewhead">
          <text class="reviewmerchant">{{item.merchant}}</text>
          <text class="siamt {{item.type === 'income' || item.type === 'refund' ? 'inc' : (item.type === 'transfer' ? 'mut' : 'exp')}}">
            {{item.type === 'income' || item.type === 'refund' ? '+' : (item.type === 'transfer' ? '' : '-')}}¥{{item.amountText}}
          </text>
        </view>
        <view class="sisub">{{item.timeText}} · {{item.category}} · {{item.imageIndex >= 0 ? '第 ' + (item.imageIndex + 1) + ' 张' : '图片序号缺失'}}</view>
        <view class="reasons">
          <text class="reason" wx:for="{{item.reviewReasons}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="reviewactions">
          <text class="reviewaction" wx:if="{{item.hasBox}}" bindtap="focusReviewItem" data-index="{{item.parsedIndex}}">定位原图</text>
          <text class="reviewaction fix" catchtap="editReviewItem" data-index="{{item.parsedIndex}}">修正</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="editbox" wx:if="{{editForm}}">
      <view class="title">修正识别项</view>
      <view class="field">商户</view>
      <input class="reviewinput" value="{{editForm.merchant}}" maxlength="48" data-field="merchant" bindinput="onReviewField" placeholder="填写商户名称"></input>
      <view class="field">金额</view>
      <input class="reviewinput" type="digit" value="{{editForm.amount}}" data-field="amount" bindinput="onReviewField" placeholder="大于 0 的金额"></input>
      <view class="field">日期</view>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{editForm.date}}" bindchange="onReviewDate">
        <view class="reviewvalue">{{editForm.date}} ›</view>
      </picker>
      <view class="field">类型</view>
      <picker range="{{editTypeOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{editTypeIndex}}" bindchange="onReviewType">
        <view class="reviewvalue">{{editTypeOptions[editTypeIndex].label}} ›</view>
      </picker>
      <view class="field">分类</view>
      <picker range="{{editCategories}}" value="{{editCategoryIndex}}" bindchange="onReviewCategory">
        <view class="reviewvalue">{{editCategories[editCategoryIndex]}} ›</view>
      </picker>
      <view class="muted edit-hint">保存后重新计算疑点，并需要再次确认才能导入。</view>
      <view class="oprow">
        <view class="btn plain half" bindtap="cancelReviewEdit">取消</view>
        <view class="btn half" bindtap="saveReviewEdit">保存修正</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="muted">前几条长这样，看对不对：</view>
    <view class="sample" wx:for="{{preview.sample}}" wx:key="sampleKey">
      <view class="ileft">
        <text class="sim">{{item.merchant}}</text>
        <text class="sisub">{{item.timeText}} · {{item.category}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="siamt {{item.type === 'income' || item.type === 'refund' ? 'inc' : (item.type === 'transfer' ? 'mut' : 'exp')}}">
        {{item.type === 'income' || item.type === 'refund' ? '+' : (item.type === 'transfer' ? '' : '-')}}¥{{item.amountText}}
      </text>
    </view>
    <view class="oprow">
      <view class="btn plain half" bindtap="redraw">重选图片</view>
      <view class="btn half" bindtap="requestImport">{{preview.lowCount > 0 ? '核对后确认导入' : '确认导入'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted tip">金额、商户、日期、类型或分类不对？点击低置信度条目的「修正」，保存后请重新确认。</view>  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{result}}">
    <view class="done">导入完成：新增 {{result.added}} 条{{result.merged ? '，合并 ' + result.merged + ' 条' : ''}}{{result.dup ? '，跳过重复 ' + result.dup + ' 条' : ''}}</view>
    <view class="btn plain" bindtap="goList">去看流水</view>
  </view>

  <view class="foot">历史流水不会自动清理，建议定期在「报表 → 数据工具」导出备份。截图识别会上传云端，共同账本会同步流水。</view>
</view>
